<title>CANADA: CWB details top feed barley markets in 1995/96.</title>
<headline>CWB details top feed barley markets in 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Wheat Board detailed Wednesday its top five markets for feed barley in crop year 1995/96 (Aug/July).</p>
<p>TOP FIVE MALT BARLEY MARKETS</p>
<p>Country	 Tonnage</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia    370,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Japan	     312,000 tonnes</p>
<p>United States    93,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Mexico	     57,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Iran		 53,000 tonnes</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
